  "music": "w1-doodle-docks",
  "authorNotes": "Solo, no chain required. Spawn on the starting pier and swing (swing-tutorial, pivot ~680,640) across the 260px gap to the middle pier — a safety-net plank sits directly beneath this whole gap, so a missed grab or a bad release in the first ~20s of play lands the player back on solid ground, never in the sea. Grab camera-1 near spawn on the way past (it is off the direct line so picking it up is optional but convenient) to be ready for the photo objective, then hang upside-down at the top of either swing's arc and use it (predicate anyInverted) for w1-01-photo. Cross the second gap on swing-crossing (pivot ~1610,590, 250px reach to the goal pier) — this crossing is over the real void hazard, so it is the first point in the level an unforced error actually costs a life; an assist beam (striped chain) spans the same gap for players who want it, at the Clock objective's usual cost. No relics, ropes or crates yet — those are levels 02+."
